sequenceDiagram
    participant Dev as Developer
    participant Konflux as Konflux CI Pipeline
    participant Cachi2 as Cachi2 Prefetch
    participant AIPCC as RHEL AI PyPI<br/>packages.redhat.com<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant RPM as RPM Repos<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Docker as Dockerfile Build<br/>(Hermetic, no network)
    participant Quay as Quay.io Registry<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Dev,Quay: Flow 1: Workbench Image Build (Konflux CI)

    Dev->>Konflux: Push to repository
    Konflux->>Cachi2: Trigger prefetch
    Cachi2->>AIPCC: Fetch Python wheels<br/>TLS 1.2+, Build secret
    AIPCC-->>Cachi2: Wheels (pylock.*.toml pinned)
    Cachi2->>RPM: Fetch RPM packages<br/>TLS 1.2+, Build secret
    RPM-->>Cachi2: RPMs (rpms.lock.yaml pinned)
    Cachi2-->>Docker: Mount at /cachi2/output/deps/
    Docker->>Docker: uv pip install --no-index<br/>(hermetic, no network)
    Docker-->>Quay: Push built image<br/>TLS 1.2+, Push secret

    participant User as User Browser
    participant Route as OpenShift Route<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant OAuth as OAuth Proxy Sidecar<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant JLab as JupyterLab Container<br/>8888/TCP HTTP
    participant S3 as S3 Object Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant HF as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over User,HF: Flow 2: Workbench Runtime (User Session)

    User->>Route: HTTPS request<br/>TLS 1.2+, OAuth2
    Route->>OAuth: Forward to OAuth proxy<br/>8443/TCP, TLS
    OAuth->>OAuth: Validate OAuth2 token
    OAuth->>JLab: Proxy to workbench<br/>8888/TCP, HTTP (localhost)
    JLab-->>User: JupyterLab UI
    JLab->>S3: Data/model access<br/>443/TCP HTTPS, Access Key
    S3-->>JLab: Data artifacts
    JLab->>HF: Download models<br/>443/TCP HTTPS, Optional token
    HF-->>JLab: Model weights
